                <pb facs="0126" n="76" sameAs="frus:frus1894/pg76"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Gresham to Mr.
                            Thompson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-11-26"><hi rendition="#italic">November 26,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Gresham instructs Mr. Thompson to press the refund of duty on flour in
                    accordance with instruction No. 176, and if necessary, to see the President in
                    regard to the matter. A telegraphic answer is requested.</p>
            </div>
